{"term": {"label": "信", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "一", "id": "一"}, {"form": "久", "id": "久"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "孔子", "id": "孔子"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "自", "id": "自"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.6635616461296463, "source": "信", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.8903717578961645, "source": "信", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.970414465569701, "source": "信", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.4107986776342782, "source": "必", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.1231166051824975, "source": "必", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "悅", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "悅", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.277267285009756, "source": "久", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.8718021769015913, "source": "久", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.5841201044498106, "source": "久", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.8909729238898652, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8109302162163288, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.5841201044498106, "source": "今", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "政", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6931471805599453, "source": "政", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "民", "target": "一"}, {"weight": 1.6376087894007967, "source": "民", "target":